  <Properties>
    <Name>JFD's Cultural Diversity - (2) (Art) Splash Screens</Name>
    <Teaser>[COLOR_CYAN]Splash Screen[ENDCOLOR] component for Cultural Diversity. Click for details.</Teaser>
